{"tembo_working_file": [{"blocks": [{"polygon": [[914.94, 415.34999999999997], [969.68, 415.34999999999997], [969.68, 468.0], [914.94, 468.0]], "confidence": 0.9784684470230519, "label": "SectionHeader", "raw_label": "Section-Header", "reading_order": 0, "html": "<h2>A</h2>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [914.94, 415.34999999999997, 969.68, 468.0]}, {"polygon": [[91.885, 678.6], [1798.6000000000001, 678.6], [1798.6000000000001, 2673.4500000000003], [91.885, 2673.4500000000003]], "confidence": 0.9784684470230519, "label": "ListGroup", "raw_label": "List-Group", "reading_order": 1, "html": "<p>-ā<sup>2-1</sup> kwāā</p><p>: kukula bila utaratibu.<br/>がつがつ食べる, むさぼり食う,<br/>manger voracement, dévorer.</p><p>mwāō (3) (myāō (4))</p><p>: namna ya kukula bila utaratibu.<br/>がつがつ食べること,<br/>voracité.</p><p>-ā<sup>2-2</sup> kwāūkirā</p><p>: kuambukia.<br/>(病気が)広がる, 伝染する, うつる,<br/>être contagieux, se contaminer.</p><p>kwāūkisā (caus.)</p><p>: kuambukiza.<br/>(病気を)うつす,<br/>contaminer.</p><p>-ā<sup>2-3</sup> kwāūlā</p><p>: kukuna.<br/>掻く,<br/>gratter (avec les ongles), griffer.</p><p>kūcāūlā (réfl.)</p><p>: kujikuna.<br/>体を掻く,<br/>se gratter.</p><p>-ā<sup>2-1</sup> kwāā</p><p>: kushindwa.<br/>議論で負ける, 誤りを認める,<br/>perdre un procès ou dans une discussion, se<br/>faire convaincre d'erreur.</p><p>kwāsā (caus.)</p><p>: kushinda.<br/>議論で勝つ, 相手を打ち負かす,<br/>convaincre qn d'erreur.</p><p>kwāsisā (caus.+appl.)</p><p>: kushindia.<br/>(人)のかわりに相手を論破する,<br/>convaincre qn pour qn d'autre.</p><p>kūcasā (réfl.+caus.)</p><p>: kujishindisha.<br/>自分の弁護がうまくできない, 白状する,<br/>s'avouer coupable.</p><p>-ā<sup>2-2</sup> kwāānā</p><p>: kugandamana.<br/>(油などが)固まる, 凝固する, (寒くて体が)ちぢ<br/>まる,<br/>se solidifier, se congeler, se faire petit de froid.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [91.885, 678.6, 1798.6000000000001, 2673.4500000000003]}, {"polygon": [[854.335, 2731.9500000000003], [1022.465, 2731.9500000000003], [1022.465, 2775.825], [854.335, 2775.825]], "confidence": 0.9784684470230519, "label": "PageFooter", "raw_label": "Page-Footer", "reading_order": 2, "html": "<p>— 1 —</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [854.335, 2731.9500000000003, 1022.465, 2775.825]}], "image_bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 1955.0, 2925.0], "page": 1}, {"blocks": [{"polygon": [[174.087, 251.206], [1886.943, 251.206], [1886.943, 2541.27], [174.087, 2541.27]], "confidence": 0.9766522465287181, "label": "Table", "raw_label": "Table", "reading_order": 0, "html": "<table border=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<td>-à<sup>2-3</sup></td>\n<td>kwâáná</td>\n<td>: kuonekana kwa muzimu.<br/>(死者の霊が)現れる.<br/>hanter, apparaître (esprit).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kwâányá (caus.)</td>\n<td>: kuonesha muzimu.<br/>(死者の霊を)呼び起す.<br/>favoriser l'apparition des esprits.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kwâánwá (pass.)</td>\n<td>: kuona muzimu, kukamatiwa na muzimu.<br/>死者の霊を見る, 死者の霊にとりつかれる.<br/>voir un esprit, être possédé.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-à<sup>2-4</sup></td>\n<td>kwâásá (+caus.)</td>\n<td>: kutokulipa deni.<br/>借金を返さない, 踏み倒す.<br/>laisser ses dettes impayées.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mwaasa (1)</td>\n<td>baasa (2)</td>\n<td>: mutu mwenyi halipake deni.<br/>なかなか借金を返さない人, 踏み倒す人.<br/>celui qui laisse ses dettes impayées.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>bwaasa (14)</td>\n<td>: hali ya kutokulipa deni.<br/>借金を返さないこと, 踏み倒すこと.<br/>état de laisser ses dettes impayées.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-à<sup>2-5</sup></td>\n<td>kwâásá (+caus.)</td>\n<td>: kukutanisha lipondo.<br/>たまたまカニをつかまえる(川へ洗濯, 水あびに<br/>行ったときなど).<br/>trouver par hasard un crabe dans une rivière.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-à<sup>2-6</sup></td>\n<td>kwâúká</td>\n<td>: kukimbilia.<br/>(〜に)逃げ込む.<br/>se sauver, se réfugier dans.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-<sup>2</sup>à<sup>2-</sup></td>\n<td>kú<sup>a</sup>ámúkwá (+pass.)</td>\n<td>: kupata ndoto ya kusemasema.<br/>ねぼける, 夢遊病者的に振舞う.<br/>agir en somnambule.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-àà</td>\n<td>caa (7)</td>\n<td>byaa (8)</td>\n<td>: -kosa, ma-; zambi, -.<br/>罪, 過失,<br/>faute, crime, péché.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kúkolá (~ kúírá) écaa</td>\n<td>: kufanya kosa.<br/>罪を犯す.<br/>commettre une faute, etc.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-<sup>2</sup>áà</td>\n<td>ciáa (7)</td>\n<td>biáa (8)</td>\n<td>: mafafa, -.<br/>肺.<br/>poumon.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-áb<sup>-1</sup></td>\n<td>kwábábá</td>\n<td>: kutoa sauti ya kilio, kulalamika.<br/>助けを求めて叫ぶ.<br/>crier au secours.</td>\n</tr>\n</table>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [174.087, 251.206, 1886.943, 2541.27]}, {"polygon": [[940.4699999999999, 2731.135], [1090.545, 2731.135], [1090.545, 2789.555], [940.4699999999999, 2789.555]], "confidence": 0.9766522465287181, "label": "PageFooter", "raw_label": "Page-Footer", "reading_order": 1, "html": "<p>— 2 —</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [940.4699999999999, 2731.135, 1090.545, 2789.555]}], "image_bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 2001.0, 2921.0], "page": 2}, {"blocks": [{"polygon": [[122.06099999999999, 233.68], [1838.919, 233.68], [1838.919, 2666.873], [122.06099999999999, 2666.873]], "confidence": 0.9895506511222245, "label": "Table", "raw_label": "Table", "reading_order": 0, "html": "<table border=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>kábábó (12)</td>\n<td>tswábábó (13)</td>\n<td>: sauti ya kilio.<br/>助けを求める叫び声,<br/>cri au secours.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-áb-<sup>2</sup></td>\n<td>kwábírírá</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kupokea.<br/>走っていって抱きつく.<br/>sauter dans les bras de qn.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-áb-<sup>3</sup></td>\n<td>kwábúká</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kusahau, kukosa.<br/>間違う, 失敗する.<br/>se tromper (de route, dans un calcul), subir un échec.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>kwábúsá (caus.)</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kusahaulisha, kukosesha.<br/>間違わせる, 失敗させる.<br/>tromper, tricher.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>mwábúsí (1)</td>\n<td>bábúsí (2)</td>\n<td>: mudanganyifu, ba-; mukorofi, ba-.<br/>ごまかす人, いかさま師.<br/>trompeur, tricheur.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-áb-<sup>4</sup></td>\n<td>kwábúlá</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kupiga ngufu.<br/>強く叩く.<br/>battre fort.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-áb-<sup>5</sup></td>\n<td>kwábúlá</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kutosha sehemu fulani ku maiti kwa kuloga.<br/>呪術のために死体の一部を切り取る.<br/>arracher ou couper un morceau d'un cadavre<br/>pour sorcellerie.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-áb-<sup>6</sup></td>\n<td>kwábúlá</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kuchunga nyama.<br/>家畜の番をする.<br/>garder le bétail.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>mwábúsí (1)</td>\n<td>bábúsí (2)</td>\n<td>: muchungaji wa nyama, ba-.<br/>家畜の番人.<br/>celui qui garde le bétail (berger, bouvier, etc.).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-âb-</td>\n<td>kwâbírá</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kushinda ngufu.<br/>打ち負かす, 人の能力を越える.<br/>vaincre, dépasser la force de qn.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>kwâbírwá (pass.)</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kushindwa.<br/>持て余す, 策がつきる.<br/>être vaincu, être à bout.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>kwâbíríbwá (pass.)</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: syn. du précédent.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>kwâbíráná</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kushindikana.<br/>御し難い, 従順でない.<br/>être indocile, ne pas obéir.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-ʔáb-<sup>1</sup></td>\n<td>kúábá</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kugawanya.<br/>分ける, 分配する.<br/>partager, diviser, distribuer.</td>\n</tr>\n</table>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [122.06099999999999, 233.68, 1838.919, 2666.873]}, {"polygon": [[894.447, 2722.3720000000003], [1050.525, 2722.3720000000003], [1050.525, 2766.187], [894.447, 2766.187]], "confidence": 0.9895506511222245, "label": "PageFooter", "raw_label": "Page-Footer", "reading_order": 1, "html": "<p>- 3 -</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [894.447, 2722.3720000000003, 1050.525, 2766.187]}], "image_bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 2001.0, 2921.0], "page": 3}, {"blocks": [{"polygon": [[166.083, 242.443], [1874.9370000000001, 242.443], [1874.9370000000001, 2579.243], [166.083, 2579.243]], "confidence": 0.981641876432359, "label": "Table", "raw_label": "Table", "reading_order": 0, "html": "<table border=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<td>múábí (1)</td>\n<td>báábí (2)</td>\n<td>: mugawanyi, ba-<br/>分ける人, 分配する人,<br/>celui qui partage, etc.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>búábí (14)</td>\n<td>: bugawanyi, -<br/>分割, 分配,<br/>partage, division, distribution.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kúábáná (ass.)</td>\n<td>: kugawanyana.<br/>分けあう.<br/>se partager entre soi.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>búábane (14)</td>\n<td>: sehemu kisha kugawanyana.<br/>分け前,<br/>part, portion, lot.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kúábwá (pass.)</td>\n<td>: kugawanywa.<br/>分けられる, 分配される.<br/>être partagé, etc.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kúábibwá (pass.)</td>\n<td>: syn. du précédent.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kúábányá (ass. + caus.)</td>\n<td>: plus ou moins syn. de <i>kúábá</i>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kúábúlá (tr.)</td>\n<td>: kugawanya kwa kupana ovyo ovyo.<br/>惜げもなく人に分け与える,<br/>distribuer libéralement.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-<sup>2</sup>áb<sup>-2</sup> kúábá</td>\n<td>: kuowesha.<br/>娘を嫁に出す,<br/>marier sa fille, la donner en mariage.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kúábírá (appl.)</td>\n<td>: kuoweshea.<br/>娘を(人)に嫁にやる,<br/>marier sa fille avec qn.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-<sup>2</sup>áb<sup>1</sup> kabí (12)</td>\n<td>tswabí (13)</td>\n<td>: pingo, (ma-).<br/>くかたち[熱湯に手を入れても, あるいは真赤に焼<br/>けた鉄に触れても火傷しない者を無罪とする],<br/>épreuve avec l'eau bouillante ou du fer rouge,<br/>ordalie.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kúáhá ékabí</td>\n<td>: kulapisha kwa pingo.<br/>くかたちにかけて誓わせる,<br/>faire jurer par l'épreuve.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-<sup>2</sup>áb<sup>2</sup> kabí (12)</td>\n<td>tswabí (13)</td>\n<td>: aina ya muti ya dawa.<br/>[植]木の一種(薬として用いる),<br/>esp. de plante médicinale.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-<sup>2</sup>ábúnyá (adj.)</td>\n<td>: (iko) sawa.<br/>~のような, ~らしい,<br/>comme, on dirait.</td>\n</tr>\n</table>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [166.083, 242.443, 1874.9370000000001, 2579.243]}, {"polygon": [[934.4670000000001, 2725.293], [1084.5420000000001, 2725.293], [1084.5420000000001, 2766.187], [934.4670000000001, 2766.187]], "confidence": 0.981641876432359, "label": "PageFooter", "raw_label": "Page-Footer", "reading_order": 1, "html": "<p>- 4 -</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [934.4670000000001, 2725.293, 1084.5420000000001, 2766.187]}], "image_bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 2001.0, 2921.0], "page": 4}, {"blocks": [{"polygon": [[276.13800000000003, 227.838], [788.394, 227.838], [788.394, 277.495], [276.13800000000003, 277.495]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 0, "html": "<p>abúnyá múndzú í nalólire kú.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [276.13800000000003, 227.838, 788.394, 277.495]}, {"polygon": [[978.489, 227.838], [1708.854, 227.838], [1708.854, 365.125], [978.489, 365.125]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 1, "html": "<p>: iko sawa mutu njoo ninaona ako.<br/>私は何か人のようなものを見た。<br/>c'est qc comme être humain que j'ai vu.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [978.489, 227.838, 1708.854, 365.125]}, {"polygon": [[276.13800000000003, 406.01900000000006], [552.2760000000001, 406.01900000000006], [552.2760000000001, 452.755], [276.13800000000003, 452.755]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 2, "html": "<p>lyabúnyá êmbe.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [276.13800000000003, 406.01900000000006, 552.2760000000001, 452.755]}, {"polygon": [[978.489, 406.01900000000006], [1368.6840000000002, 406.01900000000006], [1368.6840000000002, 540.385], [978.489, 540.385]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 3, "html": "<p>: iko sawa lipembe.<br/>これは角のようだ。<br/>on dirait une corne.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [978.489, 406.01900000000006, 1368.6840000000002, 540.385]}, {"polygon": [[276.13800000000003, 584.2], [856.428, 584.2], [856.428, 630.936], [276.13800000000003, 630.936]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 4, "html": "<p>mwá mwanyi mwabúnyá múnolá.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [276.13800000000003, 584.2, 856.428, 630.936]}, {"polygon": [[978.489, 584.2], [1640.82, 584.2], [1640.82, 718.566], [978.489, 718.566]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 5, "html": "<p>: mwangu muko sawa humu.<br/>私の家の中もこんなものです。<br/>c'est qc comme ça dans ma maison.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [978.489, 584.2, 1640.82, 718.566]}, {"polygon": [[276.13800000000003, 759.46], [482.241, 759.46], [482.241, 806.196], [276.13800000000003, 806.196]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 6, "html": "<p>abúnyá (16)</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [276.13800000000003, 759.46, 482.241, 806.196]}, {"polygon": [[978.489, 759.46], [1398.6989999999998, 759.46], [1398.6989999999998, 893.826], [978.489, 893.826]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 7, "html": "<p>: kuna mara.<br/>恐らく。<br/>peut-être, sans doute.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [978.489, 759.46, 1398.6989999999998, 893.826]}, {"polygon": [[116.058, 931.799], [214.107, 931.799], [214.107, 981.456], [116.058, 981.456]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 8, "html": "<p>-ʔácì</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [116.058, 931.799, 214.107, 981.456]}, {"polygon": [[276.13800000000003, 931.799], [444.222, 931.799], [444.222, 981.456], [276.13800000000003, 981.456]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 9, "html": "<p>lúáci (11)</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [276.13800000000003, 931.799, 444.222, 981.456]}, {"polygon": [[630.315, 931.799], [806.403, 931.799], [806.403, 981.456], [630.315, 981.456]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 10, "html": "<p>ngáci (10)</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [630.315, 931.799, 806.403, 981.456]}, {"polygon": [[978.489, 931.799], [1826.913, 931.799], [1826.913, 1115.8220000000001], [978.489, 1115.8220000000001]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 11, "html": "<p>: muti murefu kidogo kwa kujenga musonge.<br/>円錐形の家(<i>káhumíró</i>)を建てるときにその骨組<br/>となる木。<br/>perche formant l'armature de hutte <i>káhumíró</i>.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [978.489, 931.799, 1826.913, 1115.8220000000001]}, {"polygon": [[116.058, 1153.795], [206.10299999999998, 1153.795], [206.10299999999998, 1203.452], [116.058, 1203.452]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 12, "html": "<p>-áfú</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [116.058, 1153.795, 206.10299999999998, 1203.452]}, {"polygon": [[276.13800000000003, 1153.795], [414.207, 1153.795], [414.207, 1203.452], [276.13800000000003, 1203.452]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 13, "html": "<p>cáfú (7)</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [276.13800000000003, 1153.795, 414.207, 1203.452]}, {"polygon": [[630.315, 1153.795], [794.397, 1153.795], [794.397, 1203.452], [630.315, 1203.452]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 14, "html": "<p>byáfú (8)</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [630.315, 1153.795, 794.397, 1203.452]}, {"polygon": [[978.489, 1153.795], [1356.678, 1153.795], [1356.678, 1291.082], [978.489, 1291.082]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 15, "html": "<p>: yalala, -.<br/>ごみ捨て場。<br/>dépotoir, décharge.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [978.489, 1153.795, 1356.678, 1291.082]}, {"polygon": [[116.058, 1331.976], [206.10299999999998, 1331.976], [206.10299999999998, 1378.712], [116.058, 1378.712]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 16, "html": "<p>-àfù</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [116.058, 