0000000003, 2389.3779999999997, 550.2750000000001, 2439.035]}, {"polygon": [[978.489, 2389.3779999999997], [1664.8319999999999, 2389.3779999999997], [1664.8319999999999, 2529.586], [978.489, 2529.586]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 34, "html": "<p>: kuachana ao kujigabula kwa mutoni.<br/>(川が)分岐する。<br/>bifurquer, se séparer (rivière).</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [978.489, 2389.3779999999997, 1664.8319999999999, 2529.586]}, {"polygon": [[892.446, 2716.53], [1046.5230000000001, 2716.53], [1046.5230000000001, 2760.345], [892.446, 2760.345]], "confidence": 0.970975594499775, "label": "PageFooter", "raw_label": "Page-Footer", "reading_order": 35, "html": "<p>= 5 =</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [892.446, 2716.53, 1046.5230000000001, 2760.345]}], "image_bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 2001.0, 2921.0], "page": 5}, {"blocks": [{"polygon": [[320.16, 236.601], [1734.867, 236.601], [1734.867, 370.967], [320.16, 370.967]], "confidence": 0.9689753449723261, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 0, "html": "<p>mwahana (3) myahana (4) : mutoni yenyi kujigabula sehemu mbili.<br/>川の支流.<br/>affluent.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [320.16, 236.601, 1734.867, 370.967]}, {"polygon": [[320.16, 411.86099999999993], [1714.857, 411.86099999999993], [1714.857, 549.148], [320.16, 549.148]], "confidence": 0.9689753449723261, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 1, "html": "<p>cahanu (7) byahanu (8) : fasi katikati ya vitu ao batu mbili.<br/>二点間の距離あるいはその空間, 間隔,<br/>espace entre deux points, intervalle.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [320.16, 411.86099999999993, 1714.857, 549.148]}, {"polygon": [[162.08100000000002, 587.121], [1740.87, 587.121], [1740.87, 727.329], [162.08100000000002, 727.329]], "confidence": 0.9689753449723261, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 2, "html": "<p>-àh-<sup>2</sup> kwâhá : kufunguka, kupasuka.<br/>ドアの開いている, (服が)破れている.<br/>être ouvert (porte), être déchiré (habit).</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [162.08100000000002, 587.121, 1740.87, 727.329]}, {"polygon": [[320.16, 765.302], [1714.857, 765.302], [1714.857, 899.668], [320.16, 899.668]], "confidence": 0.9689753449723261, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 3, "html": "<p>kwâhúlá (tr.) : kufungula, kupasula.<br/>(ドアを)開く, (服を)破る.<br/>ouvrir, déchirer.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [320.16, 765.302, 1714.857, 899.668]}, {"polygon": [[320.16, 937.6410000000001], [1874.9370000000001, 937.6410000000001], [1874.9370000000001, 1074.9279999999999], [320.16, 1074.9279999999999]], "confidence": 0.9689753449723261, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 4, "html": "<p>mwahuré (adj. inv. 18?) : wazi.<br/>空(から)の,<br/>vide.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [320.16, 937.6410000000001, 1874.9370000000001, 1074.9279999999999]}, {"polygon": [[320.16, 1118.743], [1874.9370000000001, 1118.743], [1874.9370000000001, 1250.1879999999999], [320.16, 1250.1879999999999]], "confidence": 0.9689753449723261, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 5, "html": "<p>nyúmbá mwahuré : nyumba wazi.<br/>空(から)の家, 戸の開け放たれている家,<br/>maison vide, dont la porte est laissée ouverte.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [320.16, 1118.743, 1874.9370000000001, 1250.1879999999999]}, {"polygon": [[162.08100000000002, 1288.161], [1714.857, 1288.161], [1714.857, 1425.4479999999999], [162.08100000000002, 1425.4479999999999]], "confidence": 0.9689753449723261, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 6, "html": "<p>-(?)àh- kwâhá~kúahá : kukuwa baridi.<br/>冷たい.<br/>être ou devenir froid, frais.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [162.08100000000002, 1288.161, 1714.857, 1425.4479999999999]}, {"polygon": [[320.16, 1466.342], [1714.857, 1466.342], [1714.857, 1603.6290000000001], [320.16, 1603.6290000000001]], "confidence": 0.968975